When using the website you agree not to:

- break the law or infringe the rights of others;
- send false, misleading or abusive messages, or use the forms to send spam or advertising;
- try to gain unauthorized access to the website, its servers or other users' data;
- disrupt the website, for example with automated requests at a rate that burdens it, or by bypassing rate limits and spam protection;
- copy the website's content in bulk with automated tools without our written permission.

We may block access if these rules are broken.

